  message: "Closed by PR #3794 (merge 7a28107df8). Synthesiser at analyze/base.py:325-386 now takes a repo_root argument; paths under repo_root normalise to relative form for both Symbol.name and Symbol.path; span.end_line reflects actual file line count (3179-line cli.py → end_line=3179). Self-analysis post-fix: 0 Symbols with absolute-path names (was 798); 9/812 file-kind Symbols still have span 1-1 (was 800/809; remaining 9 are real 1-line files or synthetic boundaries). Sibling tracker INV-dihif (explain absolute-path leak) closes as downstream consequence."  # 2426
